00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.090
And so with that, we can
start building our models

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:41.230
on top of those data structures
with the goal of, hopefully,

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:43.600
giving us much more
accurate models,

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.090
because it was based on data
that actually represented

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:47.350
what was available.

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:48.850
So it's been a lot
of fun for me to,

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:51.460
first, be on that customer
