how you should be deploying

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.360
Hortonworks on Google Cloud.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:41.360
And then, finally, Jon, product
manager from Hortonworks,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.080
has an awesome demo with
